<span>Chuẩn Bộ Y Tế</span>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 font-label-xs text-label-xs">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base text-primary">verified</span>
<span>Hi-Trust Safe</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Right Footer Copyright -->
<div class="w-full text-center mt-6">
<p class="font-label-xs text-label-xs text-outline">
          © 2025 Vitalis Healthcare Technology JSC. Bảo lưu mọi quyền. Phiên bản hệ thống v3.8.4
